wg-cockpit-fuel = FUEL
wg-cockpit-fuel-low = LOW
wg-cockpit-fuel-sources = Reporting reserves from { $sources } installed fuel sources.
wg-cockpit-fuel-no-signal = No ship fuel telemetry is available.
wg-cockpit-fuel-no-sources = No installed fuel sources report reserves.
wg-cockpit-fuel-incomplete = Fuel telemetry is unavailable for { $unknown } of { $sources } installed fuel sources.
wg-cockpit-fuel-help = Average reserve across installed generators and reactors, including those switched off. Nuclear reserves use remaining fuel-rod activity. Loose generators and spare fuel are excluded. This percentage does not predict operating time.
wg-cockpit-fuel-low-help = FUEL LOW lights amber at { $low }% or less, red below { $critical }% and flashes below { $emergency }%. It stays dark unless all installed sources report their reserves.
